<div class="multicolumn multicolumn--template--14957223739490__a017e53b-ccf7-4bc9-a0ba-ab443a454650 color--underneath-default"><div class="color--bg-senary" style="padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 50px;">
    <div class="container--page"><ul class="grid--2-columns grid--2-columns--medium-down list--unstyled "><li class="multicolumn__item multicolumn__item--template--14957223739490__a017e53b-ccf7-4bc9-a0ba-ab443a454650-template--14957223739490__a017e53b-ccf7-4bc9-a0ba-ab443a454650-column-1   container--copy-max-width align--block-center element--full-width" >
            <div class="multicolumn__content flex flex--column flex--align-center space--gap--small"><div class="flex flex--column space--gap--small"><div class="rte copy--small">
                    <p>1. <strong>Start with today's rhythm</strong> - open the Little Ones App each morning and see a personalised sleep rhythm created for your baby, based on their exact age and stage.</p><p>2. <strong>Track what actually happens </strong>- baby woke early? Nap was short? Slept longer than expected? Log it in the app using the easy trackers.</p><p>3. <strong>We adapt the rest of the day</strong> - Sleep o Rhythm adjusts your baby's routine in real time, so you always know what comes next.</p>
                  </div></div>
            </div>
          </li><li class="multicolumn__item multicolumn__item--template--14957223739490__a017e53b-ccf7-4bc9-a0ba-ab443a454650-f367b127-68a9-4935-a331-9333d5767a2f   container--copy-max-width align--block-center element--full-width" >
            <div class="multicolumn__content flex flex--column flex--align-center space--gap--small"><div class="flex flex--column space--gap--small"><div class="rte copy--small">
                    <p>♡ <strong>Real time sleep adjustments</strong> - adaptable<strong> </strong>to real life and unique to <em>your</em> baby</p><p>♡ <strong>Wake windows</strong> - know when wake windows are changing & regressions are coming</p><p>♡ <strong>New sleep challenges</strong> - Get the right guidance for early wakes, night wakes, self-settling and whatever comes next.</p><p>♡ <strong>Private sleep consultant</strong> chat for extra support</p>
                  </div></div>
            </div>
          </li></ul>
    </div>
