  }</style><div class="media-with-text media-with-text--template--14957223739490__image_with_textbox_VnP7wh color--underneath-senary media-with-text--bottom-overlap">
  <div class="media-with-text__wrapper media-with-text--media-skinny media-with-text--text-first color--bg-senary">
    <div class="container--page">
      <div class="media-with-text__container flex--align-end media-with-text__container--bottom-overlap">
        <div class="media-with-text__media-container media-with-text__media-container--bottom-overlap">
          <div class="element--shape-container element--aspect-ratio-square element--square fade-in-image"><img src="//www.littleones.co/cdn/shop/files/14_d49ccfe2-9b5e-47ef-8c5e-e9baccf46bf7.png?v=1787273943&amp;width=3000" alt="" srcset="//www.littleones.co/cdn/shop/files/14_d49ccfe2-9b5e-47ef-8c5e-e9baccf46bf7.png?v=1787273943&amp;width=375 375w, //www.littleones.co/cdn/shop/files/14_d49ccfe2-9b5e-47ef-8c5e-e9baccf46bf7.png?v=1787273943&amp;width=550 550w, //www.littleones.co/cdn/shop/files/14_d49ccfe2-9b5e-47ef-8c5e-e9baccf46bf7.png?v=1787273943&amp;width=720 720w, //www.littleones.co/cdn/shop/files/14_d49ccfe2-9b5e-47ef-8c5e-e9baccf46bf7.png?v=1787273943&amp;width=990 990w, //www.littleones.co/cdn/shop/files/14_d49ccfe2-9b5e-47ef-8c5e-e9baccf46bf7.png?v=1787273943&amp;width=1200 1200w, //www.littleones.co/cdn/shop/files/14_d49ccfe2-9b5e-47ef-8c5e-e9baccf46bf7.png?v=1787273943&amp;width=1500 1500w, //www.littleones.co/cdn/shop/files/14_d49ccfe2-9b5e-47ef-8c5e-e9baccf46bf7.png?v=1787273943&amp;width=2000 2000w, //www.littleones.co/cdn/shop/files/14_d49ccfe2-9b5e-47ef-8c5e-e9baccf46bf7.png?v=1787273943&amp;width=2400 2400w, //www.littleones.co/cdn/shop/files/14_d49ccfe2-9b5e-47ef-8c5e-e9baccf46bf7.png?v=1787273943&amp;width=3000 3000w" width="3000" height="2986" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 768px) 40vw, 100vw" class="object-fit__image--cover">
</div>
        </div>
        <div class="media-with-text__content animate animate--none  flex flex--align-center--justify-center space--pv--large space--viewport-sides">
          <div class="animate__step-container flex flex--column flex--justify-center space--gap--medium content-box--text-align-center">
            <h2 class="type--heading title--small">
              Why parents love our Sleep App
            </h2>
            <ul class="textbox-list-container"><li  class="textbox-item-container"><div class="textbox">
                      <h3 class="textbox__heading"><span class="textbox__icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" role="presentation" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="32" height="32" class=""><path d="M16.5 3C19.538 3 22 5.5 22 9c0 7-7.5 11-10 12.5C9.5 20 2 16 2 9c0-3.5 2.5-6 5.5-6C9.36 3 11 4 12 5c1-1 2.64-2 4.5-2zm-3.566 15.604c.881-.556 1.676-1.109 2.42-1.701C18.335 14.533 20 11.943 20 9c0-2.36-1.537-4-3.5-4-1.076 0-2.24.57-3.086 1.414L12 7.828l-1.414-1.414C9.74 5.57 8.576 5 7.5 5 5.56 5 4 6.656 4 9c0 2.944 1.666 5.533 4.645 7.903.745.592 1.54 1.145 2.421 1.7.299.189.595.37.934.572.339-.202.635-.383.934-.571z" /></svg>
</span>
                          
</h3><div class="textbox__text rte copy--small">
                          <p>"Your new private 1:1 chat is absolutely outstanding. It's where the most help comes in in my opinion. Especially during nap transitions."</p>
                        </div></div></li><li  class="textbox-item-container"><div class="textbox">
                      <h3 class="textbox__heading"><span class="textbox__icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" role="presentation" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="32" height="32" class=""><path d="M16.5 3C19.538 3 22 5.5 22 9c0 7-7.5 11-10 12.5C9.5 20 2 16 2 9c0-3.5 2.5-6 5.5-6C9.36 3 11 4 12 5c1-1 2.64-2 4.5-2zm-3.566 15.604c.881-.556 1.676-1.109 2.42-1.701C18.335 14.533 20 11.943 20 9c0-2.36-1.537-4-3.5-4-1.076 0-2.24.57-3.086 1.414L12 7.828l-1.414-1.414C9.74 5.57 8.576 5 7.5 5 5.56 5 4 6.656 4 9c0 2.944 1.666 5.533 4.645 7.903.745.592 1.54 1.145 2.421 1.7.299.189.595.37.934.572.339-.202.635-.383.934-.571z" /></svg>
</span>
                          
</h3><div class="textbox__text rte copy--small">
                          <p>"I LOVE the App, it’s there on my phone to quickly access at any time. App is easy to use, very intuitive - I can easily switch between children’s profiles and plans when I need to."</p>
                        </div></div></li><li  class="textbox-item-container"><div class="textbox">
                      <h3 class="textbox__heading"><span class="textbox__icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" role="presentation" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="32" height="32" class=""><path d="M16.5 3C19.538 3 22 5.5 22 9c0 7-7.5 11-10 12.5C9.5 20 2 16 2 9c0-3.5 2.5-6 5.5-6C9.36 3 11 4 12 5c1-1 2.64-2 4.5-2zm-3.566 15.604c.881-.556 1.676-1.109 2.42-1.701C18.335 14.533 20 11.943 20 9c0-2.36-1.537-4-3.5-4-1.076 0-2.24.57-3.086 1.414L12 7.828l-1.414-1.414C9.74 5.57 8.576 5 7.5 5 5.56 5 4 6.656 4 9c0 2.944 1.666 5.533 4.645 7.903.745.592 1.54 1.145 2.421 1.7.299.189.595.37.934.572.339-.202.635-.383.934-.571z" /></svg>
</span>
                          
</h3><div class="textbox__text rte copy--small">
                          <p>"I've used Little Ones for three babies and it is a godsend. Having the content in an app is amazing. It means I can access it, one handed, while trying to get baby to sleep or during a feed.</p><p>The personalisation on the app is stellar."</p>
                        </div></div></li><li  class="textbox-item-container"><div class="textbox">
                      <h3 class="textbox__heading"><span class="textbox__icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" role="presentation" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="32" height="32" class=""><path d="M16.5 3C19.538 3 22 5.5 22 9c0 7-7.5 11-10 12.5C9.5 20 2 16 2 9c0-3.5 2.5-6 5.5-6C9.36 3 11 4 12 5c1-1 2.64-2 4.5-2zm-3.566 15.604c.881-.556 1.676-1.109 2.42-1.701C18.335 14.533 20 11.943 20 9c0-2.36-1.537-4-3.5-4-1.076 0-2.24.57-3.086 1.414L12 7.828l-1.414-1.414C9.74 5.57 8.576 5 7.5 5 5.56 5 4 6.656 4 9c0 2.944 1.666 5.533 4.645 7.903.745.592 1.54 1.145 2.421 1.7.299.189.595.37.934.572.339-.202.635-.383.934-.571z" /></svg>
</span>
                          
</h3><div class="textbox__text rte copy--small">
                          <p>"I purchased this app for my second baby. For my first one I used a different app (huckleberry) to track the sleeping whilst following the principles of Little Ones. So when I found out there was an app available when number two came along I knew I needed it!" </p>
                        </div></div></li></ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>


