<div class="ai-image-text-block-abjrwc1dxzhz5djlccaigenblock1e228f2whpnaa" >
  <div class="ai-image-text-container-abjrwc1dxzhz5djlccaigenblock1e228f2whpnaa">
    <div class="ai-image-text-content-abjrwc1dxzhz5djlccaigenblock1e228f2whpnaa">
      
        <h2 class="ai-image-text-heading-abjrwc1dxzhz5djlccaigenblock1e228f2whpnaa">Hi, we're Amanda & Nicky</h2>
      
      
        <div class="ai-image-text-text-abjrwc1dxzhz5djlccaigenblock1e228f2whpnaa"><p>We're certified <strong>Pediatric Sleep Specialists</strong>, NZ mums, and the founders of Little Ones®, the sleep app trusted by over 1 million families worldwide and endorsed by Dr Kate Johnson (Ph.D. Sleep Physiology, <strong>Harvard Medical School</strong>).</p><p><br/>We built the Little Ones® Sleep App to give you clear, day to day guidance that works <strong>with your baby's development</strong> and continues to fit into your real life. Because when your baby sleeps well, your <strong>whole family</strong> feels the difference. </p></div>
      
    </div>

    <div class="ai-image-text-image-wrapper-abjrwc1dxzhz5djlccaigenblock1e228f2whpnaa">
      
        <img
          src="//www.littleones.co/cdn/shop/files/Amanda_Snedden_and_Nicky_Barker_Founders_of_Little_Ones.jpg?v=1753237154&width=1200"
