        <div class="media-with-text__content animate animate--none  flex flex--align-center--justify-center space--pv--large space--viewport-sides">
          <div class="animate__step-container flex flex--column flex--justify-center space--gap--medium content-box--text-align-center"><h2 class="type--heading title--medium" style="--i: 1" >
                    Become a Little Ones® Certified Sleep Consultant
                  </h2><div class="rte copy--small " style="--i: 2" >
                    <p>For over a decade, Little Ones has helped more than <strong>1 million families</strong> navigate the challenges of baby and toddler sleep. Now, for the first time, we're opening our proven methodology to the next generation of sleep consultants.</p><p>Train with one of the world's most trusted baby sleep brand, then use your knowledge and accreditation to build your <strong>own independent sleep consulting business</strong>. Work from home, choose your own hours, support families through one of the most important seasons of their lives, and enjoy a rewarding career with real purpose. As a Little Ones Certified Sleep Consultant, you'll also become part of our growing professional community, backed by the expertise and reputation that parents already know and trust.</p>
                  </div><div class="content-box__buttons" style="--i: 3" ><a
                         href="https://babysleepconsultantcourse.com/"
                        class="button "
                        >
                          
                          Explore the Course
                      </a></div></div>
