<article class="article-card blog-posts__post blog-posts__post--featured article-card--featured article-card--half-arch" aria-labelledby="Article-206330317"><a href="/blogs/our-blog/every-2-hours-why-your-baby-wakes-2-hourly-overnight" class="image-container image-container--article article-card__image-container fade-in-image link--no-underline"><img src="//www.littleones.co/cdn/shop/articles/Baby_Waking_Every_2_hours_15700a8d-c2a7-4b70-916d-dac45883346c.jpg?v=1779757318&amp;width=2000" alt="Baby holding a clock showing that they are waking every two hours" srcset="//www.littleones.co/cdn/shop/articles/Baby_Waking_Every_2_hours_15700a8d-c2a7-4b70-916d-dac45883346c.jpg?v=1779757318&amp;width=375 375w, //www.littleones.co/cdn/shop/articles/Baby_Waking_Every_2_hours_15700a8d-c2a7-4b70-916d-dac45883346c.jpg?v=1779757318&amp;width=550 550w, //www.littleones.co/cdn/shop/articles/Baby_Waking_Every_2_hours_15700a8d-c2a7-4b70-916d-dac45883346c.jpg?v=1779757318&amp;width=720 720w, //www.littleones.co/cdn/shop/articles/Baby_Waking_Every_2_hours_15700a8d-c2a7-4b70-916d-dac45883346c.jpg?v=1779757318&amp;width=990 990w, //www.littleones.co/cdn/shop/articles/Baby_Waking_Every_2_hours_15700a8d-c2a7-4b70-916d-dac45883346c.jpg?v=1779757318&amp;width=1200 1200w, //www.littleones.co/cdn/shop/articles/Baby_Waking_Every_2_hours_15700a8d-c2a7-4b70-916d-dac45883346c.jpg?v=1779757318&amp;width=1500 1500w, //www.littleones.co/cdn/shop/articles/Baby_Waking_Every_2_hours_15700a8d-c2a7-4b70-916d-dac45883346c.jpg?v=1779757318&amp;width=2000 2000w" width="2000" height="1250" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 768px) 80vw, (min-width: 900px) 900px, 100vw" class="object-fit__image--cover">
